@startuml
title SSD 5 — Cancel Appointment and Offer Available Appointment
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor "Patient / AdministrativeStaff" as Canceller
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
actor "Waitlisted Patient" as Patient
participant ":System" as System
Canceller -> System: cancelAppointment(appointmentID)
alt cancellation rejected
  System --> Canceller: notFound / accessDenied / invalidState
else cancellation succeeds
  System --> Canceller: appointmentID, status = cancelled
  System --> Staff: eligible entries (entryID, patientID, criteria),\nhighest priority first (possibly empty)
  loop priority order: while staff continues, slot available, and no successful booking
    note over Staff,Patient
    Staff selects the highest-priority eligible entry not yet contacted in this round.
    Staff may choose among entries of equal priority; no automatic calling.
    end note
    Staff -> Patient: Offer available appointment by phone (outside software)
    Patient --> Staff: Accept or decline
    alt patient accepts
      Staff -> System: requestAppointment(patientID, serviceID, professionalID,\nlocationID, dateTime, referralID?, waitingListEntryID = entryID)
      alt booking and selected-entry validation succeed
        System --> Staff: appointmentID, status = requested, entryID, entryStatus = accepted
        note over Staff,System
        Atomically book, link this exact entry, and mark it accepted.
        Other matching entries are unchanged; stop this offer round.
        end note
      else availability changed or validation fails
        System --> Staff: slotUnavailable / resourceUnavailable / referralRequired /\nreferralInvalid / invalidInput / notFound
        note over Staff,System: No appointment or entry changes; stop if the slot is no longer available.
      end
    else patient declines
      opt staff chooses to remove patient from waiting list
        Staff -> System: removeWaitingListEntry(entryID)
        System --> Staff: entryID, status = removed
      end
      note over Staff,System: Otherwise the patient stays on the waiting list and may receive a later offer.
    end
  end
end
note over Staff,System
Cancellation frees appointment capacity and its allocated resources.
The system identifies eligible entries using their preferences and priority.
Declined entries not removed remain eligible for later offer rounds.
A phone offer does not reserve capacity; acceptance uses normal booking validation.
No offer IDs, hold/withdrawal workflow, automatic removal or new eligibility ban.
end note
@enduml
